    "Self-selected role assignment is N/A for LLM personas; role is set at persona-generation time. Cell-size imbalance reflects the persona-generation budget, not recruitment bias.",
    "Some persona \u00d7 alert calls failed with OpenAI 429 rate-limit errors; statistical analysis operates on successful rows only. Failures treated as MCAR per the rate-limit error class.",
    "Escalation collapsed to a binary outcome (escalated_appropriately) at persona level via a >=0.5 rule. Graded escalation severity is future work.",
    "Under the real correct_action vocabulary, only correct_action == 'isolate' satisfies the escalation-class set, so the appropriate-escalation rule effectively reduces to 'correct_action is isolate AND persona escalated/isolated'. Documented in configs/rq3_escalation_definition.yaml."
  ],
